SaikaiPTT Japanese ASR model files
==================================

These four files are redistributed unmodified from the ONNX export of the
ReazonSpeech k2 v2 Japanese speech recognition model: the int8 quantised
encoder, decoder and joiner, and the token table. The fp32 weights
published alongside them are omitted because a phone never loads them.
Nothing that is included has been altered in any way.

  encoder-epoch-99-avg-1.int8.onnx   154,670,139 bytes
  decoder-epoch-99-avg-1.int8.onnx     2,959,337 bytes
  joiner-epoch-99-avg-1.int8.onnx      2,696,970 bytes
  tokens.txt                              45,754 bytes

